      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "In this case, admittedly, fine has been awarded exceeding one hundred rupees and therefore, when a question was posed to the learned counsel for the petitioners instead of preferring the appeal before the Sessions Judge, Puri under section 374 Cr.P.C., how they have preferred this revision, he seeks some time to examine on this point.",
